🎨 Cartoon AI

An AI-powered image transformation application that converts ordinary photos into creative artistic styles such as Cartoon, Pencil Sketch, Painting, and more.

🚀 Overview

Cartoon AI is an AI-based image processing project designed to transform uploaded images into different artistic styles. Users can upload an image, select a desired style, and generate a transformed version using AI/image-processing techniques.

The project focuses on creating a simple, interactive, and user-friendly experience for experimenting with AI-powered image transformations.

✨ Features

- 🖼️ Upload images easily
- 🎨 Convert images into different artistic styles
- ✏️ Pencil Sketch transformation
- 🖌️ Painting / Artistic transformation
- 🤖 AI-powered image processing
- ⚡ Fast image transformation
- 👀 Preview the generated image
- 💾 Save/download transformed images
- 📱 Simple and responsive interface

🎯 Supported Styles

Style| Description
🎨 Cartoon| Converts the image into a cartoon-style artwork
✏️ Pencil Sketch| Creates a pencil-drawn sketch effect
🖌️ Painting| Applies an artistic painting effect
🌈 Artistic| Applies creative visual transformations

