⚙️ Installation

1. Clone the repository

git clone https://github.com/your-username/Cartoon-AI.git
cd Cartoon-AI

2. Create a virtual environment

python -m venv venv

3. Activate the environment

Windows:

venv\Scripts\activate

Linux / macOS:

source venv/bin/activate

4. Install dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

5. Run the application

python app.py

Then open the local URL shown in the terminal.

📸 How It Works

1. Upload an image.
2. Select the required artistic style.
3. The application preprocesses the image.
4. AI/image-processing techniques transform the image.
5. The generated result is displayed.
6. Download the final artwork.

